	`Board resolutions 21/09/22 and 11/11/22`
	`21/09/22 and 11/11/22`
	`20/11/22`
	`Payments NZ, Buddle Findlay`
	`Version 2. Amendments to provide a more co-ordinated structure for participant testing during the ISO 20022 co-existence phase.`
	`Board resolution 30 July 24`
	`6 August 24`
